// Expanded orchestration of the complete CC0 trio edition. Original flute, violin and clarinet lines remain intact. Cello supports the explicitly written third-voice downbeats one octave below; harp realizes the existing oom-pah-pah accompaniment attacks, viola reinforces simultaneous inner harmony on beats two and phrase endings. Sparse triangle marks eight-bar arrivals; no continuous percussion. All original pitches/onsets/durations/velocities, ties, full form, editorial tempo map and meter retained.
